+      "title": "New project, plan and review-only",
+      "criteria": "Seeded ambiguity is asked about; a multi-increment request yields an editable plan; the starter journey runs with tests; review-only creates no files (watched filesystem events plus final hashes) and runs no mutating commands; \"fix N and M\" scopes correctly",
+      "sourceLine": 1140,
+      "tiers": [
+        "T1",
+        "T3"
+      ]
+    },
+    "AC-05": {
+      "title": "TDD evidence",
+      "criteria": "Distinguishing reproduction fails on baseline and passes on candidate; preservation cases pass on both as expected; scaffolding gives behavioral red; import errors alone fail the red requirement; a vacuous assertion is rejected as insufficient evidence; prototype promotion follows WRK-07",
